{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55418","headline":"萍乡春晚寓居（四首） 二 · 沈彬","name":"萍乡春晚寓居（四首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花替残红草绿深，江头闲事岂堪寻。\n云山忆後思藏迹，家国话来长痛心。\n战地血流犹未服，侯门心热更相歆。\n求归闲处无闲处。\n三纪兵戈犹至今。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}